# ABOUT MPP GROUP

## Empowering Businesses Through Smart Technology

MPP Group is a technology-driven software development company dedicated to transforming businesses through innovative digital solutions. We specialize in developing intelligent, reliable, scalable, and user-friendly software systems that simplify operations, improve productivity, and accelerate business growth.

From educational institutions and healthcare organizations to computer training centers, coaching institutes, and growing businesses, we deliver technology solutions designed to meet real-world challenges.

We believe technology should make businesses smarter, operations easier, and growth faster.

## WHO WE ARE

### Your Technology Partner for Digital Transformation

At MPP Group, we combine technology, creativity, and industry knowledge to build solutions that make a difference.

We develop customized software and websites that help organizations manage their daily operations, improve efficiency, connect with customers, and embrace digital transformation.

Our focus is not just on developing software but on creating long-term technology solutions that grow with your business.

## WHAT WE DO

### Complete Software & Digital Development Solutions

**01. School Management Software**

Smart school management solutions designed to simplify educational administration, student management, attendance, fee collection, examinations, results, communication, and institutional operations.

**02. Hospital Management Software**

Comprehensive hospital management solutions to streamline patient records, appointments, OPD, IPD, billing, pharmacy, laboratory, doctors, staff, and hospital administration.

**03. Computer Institute Software**

Complete ERP solutions for computer training institutes, including student admissions, courses, batches, fees, attendance, examinations, certificates, franchises, and student management.

**04. Coaching Management Software**

Smart coaching institute management systems for student enrollment, batch scheduling, attendance, fee management, online examinations, results, study materials, and performance tracking.

**05. Custom Software Development**

We develop tailor-made software applications according to your business requirements, workflows, and operational needs. From business automation to complex enterprise applications, we turn ideas into practical digital solutions.

**06. Custom Website Development**

We design and develop modern, responsive, SEO-friendly, and performance-focused websites that strengthen your online presence and help businesses connect with their audiences.

